cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'EIC Tutorial: Kinematic Reconstruction (ePIC tutorial)'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Stephen
    family-names: Kay
  - name: The ePIC Collaboration
abstract: >-
  An ePIC tutorial on kinematic reconstruction that shows how to access the
  reconstructed inclusive kinematics in the simulation output, benchmark the
  performance of the different reconstruction methods, and implement and
  optimise the reconstruction manually. Built with The Carpentries Workbench.
keywords:
  - EIC
  - ePIC
  - eic-shell
  - kinematic reconstruction
  - inclusive kinematics
  - DIS
  - EICrecon
  - edm4eic
